# Spreadsheets are never committed.
#
# Both the input workbook and the generated rota are reproducible from the
# script in two commands:
#
#   python lab_roster.py template --out roster_input.xlsx
#   python lab_roster.py generate --input roster_input.xlsx --out rota.xlsx
#
# The input workbook is the file you fill in with real staff names, bands and
# leave. That is personal data, and git history keeps it permanently - a later
# deletion does not remove it from earlier commits. So the whole file type is
# ignored rather than relying on remembering which copy is safe.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.csv

# Excel lock files, created while a workbook is open
~$*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
